  "notes": [
    "The Lost Choir \u2014 vertical slice zone, docs/design/vertical-slice.md \u00a76.",
    "Authored by hand against the LDtk export schema (entityInstances / fieldInstances / px)",
    "so the runtime importer (scripts/levels/ldtk_project.gd) can be swapped to a real LDtk",
    "export later without changing the reader. Placeholder blockout geometry only \u2014 Art",
    "integration replaces SolidRect entities with real tileset IntGrid content in a later pass."
